#: templates/library_update.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "Edit description"
msgstr "Editatu deskribapena"

#: templates/select_legend_type.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "All the features of the layer are drawn with the same symbol. It is the simplest option, ideal for showing where things are without distinguishing categories."
msgstr "Geruzako elementu guztiak ikur berarekin marrazten dira. Aukerarik errazena da, gauzak non dauden erakusteko aproposa, kategoriak bereizi gabe."

#: templates/select_legend_type.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "Assigns a different symbol to each distinct value of a field. Use it when the data are classified in categories or types."
msgstr "Ikur desberdin bat esleitzen dio eremu bateko balio bakoitzari. Erabili datuak kategoria edo motatan sailkatuta daudenean."

#: templates/select_legend_type.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "Assigns colors to the values of the raster, either by exact value or as a continuous ramp between values."
msgstr "Rasterreko balioei koloreak esleitzen dizkie, balio zehatzaren arabera edo balioen arteko arrapala jarraitu gisa."

#: templates/select_legend_type.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "Each rule has its own filter combining fields and conditions (AND / OR), its own symbol and its own scales. It is the most flexible option."
msgstr "Arau bakoitzak bere iragazkia du, eremuak eta baldintzak konbinatzen dituena (ETA / EDO), bere ikurra eta bere eskalak. Aukerarik malguena da."

#: templates/select_legend_type.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "Elevation models, land cover classes."
msgstr "Altuera-ereduak, lurzoru-estalduraren klaseak."

#: templates/select_legend_type.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Adibidea"

#: templates/select_legend_type.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "Groups nearby points into a single symbol that shows how many there are, and separates them as you zoom in. Avoids overloaded maps."
msgstr "Hurbileko puntuak ikur bakar batean taldekatzen ditu, zenbat dauden adierazten duena, eta hurbiltzean bereizten ditu. Mapa gainkargatuak saihesten ditu."

#: templates/select_legend_type.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "Groups the values of a numeric field into ranges and gives each range a symbol, with a color ramp if you wish. Suitable for quantities that vary continuously."
msgstr "Eremu numeriko baten balioak tartetan taldekatzen ditu eta tarte bakoitzari ikur bat ematen dio, nahi izanez gero kolore-arrapala batekin. Modu jarraituan aldatzen diren kantitateetarako egokia."

#: templates/select_legend_type.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "Incidents, accidents, sightings."
msgstr "Gorabeherak, istripuak, behaketak."

#: templates/select_legend_type.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "Land use, road type, protection category."
msgstr "Lurzoruaren erabilera, bide mota, babes-kategoria."

#: templates/select_legend_type.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "Municipal boundaries, a road network, protected areas."
msgstr "Udal-mugak, errepide-sare bat, eremu babestuak."

#: templates/select_legend_type.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "Population, density, area, income."
msgstr "Biztanleria, dentsitatea, azalera, errenta."

#: templates/select_legend_type.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "Shows the density of the features as a continuous color surface instead of individual symbols. You choose the radius and, optionally, a field to weight each feature."
msgstr "Elementuen dentsitatea kolore-gainazal jarraitu gisa erakusten du, banakako ikurren ordez. Erradioa aukeratzen duzu eta, nahi izanez gero, elementu bakoitza haztatzeko eremu bat."

#: templates/select_legend_type.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "Styles prepared in gvSIG Desktop or GeoServer."
msgstr "gvSIG Desktopen edo GeoServerren prestatutako estiloak."

#: templates/select_legend_type.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "Thousands of points of interest in a city."
msgstr "Hiri bateko milaka interesgune."

#: templates/select_legend_type.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "Write or paste the SLD of the style directly in an editor. For advanced users who need options that the other legends do not offer."
msgstr "Idatzi edo itsatsi estiloaren SLDa zuzenean editore batean. Beste legendek eskaintzen ez dituzten aukerak behar dituzten erabiltzaile aurreratuentzat."

#: templates/select_legend_type.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "«type = school AND students > 500»."
msgstr "«mota = ikastetxea ETA ikasleak > 500»."

#: templates/external_graphic_add.html
msgctxt "symbology"
msgid "PNG or SVG. SVG symbols are scaled without losing quality; scripts and external references are removed when saving."
msgstr "PNG edo SVG. SVG ikurrak kalitaterik galdu gabe eskalatzen dira; gordetzean scriptak eta kanpoko erreferentziak kentzen dira."

#: external_graphics.py
msgid "The SVG file is too large (maximum 1 MB)."
msgstr "SVG fitxategia handiegia da (gehienez 1 MB)."

#: external_graphics.py
msgid "The SVG file is not valid."
msgstr "SVG fitxategia ez da baliozkoa."

#: external_graphics.py
msgid "The SVG file must define its size (width and height, or a viewBox)."
msgstr "SVG fitxategiak bere tamaina adierazi behar du (width eta height, edo viewBox bat)."
